        "202270000": {
          "id": 202270000,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1502,
          "text": "You've been enjoying your leisurely vacation, and you've been busy eating and drinking",
          "next": [
            202270001
          ]
        },
        "202270001": {
          "id": 202270001,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1502,
          "text": "You're way better at taking it easy than I am on the days meant for relaxing",
          "next": [
            202270002
          ]
        },
        "202270002": {
          "id": 202270002,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1502,
          "text": "Don't get me wrong. It's a sincere compliment.",
          "next": [
            202270003
          ]
        },
        "202270003": {
          "id": 202270003,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1502,
          "text": "Once I'm done with all this work, I'll have a break too. Got any tips on how to unwind and de-stress?",
          "next": [
            202270004,
            202270006,
            202270008
          ]
        },
        "202270004": {
          "id": 202270004,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "Player",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "Get some sleep to empty your mind, and there is nothing you can't do in your dreams",
          "next": [
            202270005
          ]
        },
        "202270005": {
          "id": 202270005,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "PlayerAuto",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "What else do you do besides playing cards?",
          "next": [
            202270011
          ]
        },
        "202270006": {
          "id": 202270006,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "Player",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "Going out for a walk, spending some money, treating myself a bit",
          "next": [
            202270007
          ]
        },
        "202270007": {
          "id": 202270007,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "PlayerAuto",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "What else do you do besides playing cards?",
          "next": [
            202270011
          ]
        },
        "202270008": {
          "id": 202270008,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "Player",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "Loosening up my muscles, keeping fit, traveling, or...",
          "next": [
            202270009
          ]
        },
        "202270009": {
          "id": 202270009,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "PlayerAuto",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "Finding another spot to game",
          "next": [
            202270010
          ]
        },
        "202270010": {
          "id": 202270010,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "PlayerAuto",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "What else do you do besides playing cards?",
          "next": [
            202270011
          ]
        },
        "202270011": {
          "id": 202270011,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1502,
          "text": "You think playing cards is my only way to de-stress? Is that all you think I'm capable of?",
          "next": [
            202270012
          ]
        },
        "202270012": {
          "id": 202270012,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1502,
          "text": "Gotta take advantage of my vacation to speedrun and break some Abacus Circuitry and Hexanexus records across the realms...",
          "next": [
            202270013
          ]
        },
        "202270013": {
          "id": 202270013,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1502,
          "text": "And solve the Five Treasures, Three Divinations riddles of the Xianzhou, extrapolate the Eight Trigrams of the whole Diting family",
          "next": [
            202270014,
            202270016,
            202270018
          ]
        },
        "202270014": {
          "id": 202270014,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "Player",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "This is your idea of a break?",
          "next": [
            202270015
          ]
        },
        "202270015": {
          "id": 202270015,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "PlayerAuto",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "When you've got nothing to do, it's totally fine to do nothing at all",
          "next": [
            202270020
          ]
        },
        "202270016": {
          "id": 202270016,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "Player",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "Talk about competitive spirit",
          "next": [
            202270017
          ]
        },
        "202270017": {
          "id": 202270017,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "PlayerAuto",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "You can take it easy",
          "next": [
            202270020
          ]
        },
        "202270018": {
          "id": 202270018,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "Player",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "The Eight Trigrams of Diting? Are they doing alright?",
          "next": [
            202270019
          ]
        },
        "202270019": {
          "id": 202270019,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1502,
          "text": "Of course, every day is fine for them. After all, they're experts at \"forgetting\"",
          "next": [
            202270020
          ]
        },
        "202270020": {
          "id": 202270020,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1502,
          "text": "Speaking of which, I couldn't focus on work earlier, so I started fortune-telling about money-making opportunities for the next five years",
          "next": [
            202270021
          ]
        },
        "202270021": {
          "id": 202270021,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1502,
          "text": "Well, well, look what I've figured out here!",
          "next": [
            202270022
          ]
        },
        "202270022": {
          "id": 202270022,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1502,
          "text": "As the saying goes, \"Fortune goes around and comes around!\"",
          "next": [
            202270023
          ]
        },
        "202270023": {
          "id": 202270023,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1502,
          "text": "Since the time is auspicious, let me put it into practice with you right now",
          "next": [
            202270024
          ]
        },
        "202270024": {
          "id": 202270024,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1502,
          "text": "There you go!",
          "next": [
            202270025
          ]
        },
